  "implementation": "PreparedPhysicalContact::victimHitValues returns copied post-contact current integer Health/Fatigue/Agility/Luck and Fatigue ratio from the staged candidate after block spending and hostile deltas. It validates the pending contact and participant/base/projection leases before querying. Missing, stale, missed, committed, moved-from or destroyed-owner plans return no values. NPC/Creature queries retain exact integer form/base overrides; Player uses its native integer composition. No publication, callback, RNG spending, new wire state or automatic reaction admission.",
  "regressions": [
    "Fractional staged Health and sequential block/hostile Fatigue changes are visible to the query while live actor arrays and serialized state remain unchanged.",
    "Form Health16777217 retains exact integer provenance above binary32 precision; fractional damage yields prepared integerHealth16777213, matching the later committed public getter.",
    "Player/Creature Fatigue and ratio queries agree with the complete pre-existing god-mode/model-collision/negative/zero/fractional delta matrix before commit.",
    "Stale actor/base/geometry/action/custom-data leases and service clear/destruction reject queries. Commit invalidates the query token; misses have no victim."
  ],
